00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:16.620
Speaker 3: In Hebrews chapter one, verse eight, the Father says to the Son your throne, O God.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.420
Speaker 3: Talking to the Son and calling him God.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:28.780
Speaker 3: In Acts 13:2, the Holy Spirit said, separate unto me Paul and Barnabas for the work that I have called them to do.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:41.169
